{title: Dil Todne Se Pehle}
{artist: Jass Manak}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Na maut tumhe aayegi [A#] na jee paaoge,        [Dm] Na bhookh tumhe lagegi
[Gm] na [C] pee paa [Dm] oge,        [Dm] Ro vi taan hona ni
[C] So vi taan hona ni,        [Dm] Ro nai hona [C] so nai hona
[A#] Yaad meri [C] tadpaayegi,        O o...
[Dm] O mera dil todne se pehle,        [C] Yeh soch lena, baari
[A#] aapki bhi [Dm] aayegi,        [Dm] Tera chhod jana meri [C] jaan le gaya hai
Itna [A#] pukara tumhe [C] gala beh [Dm] gaya hai
[Dm] Tera chhod jana meri [C] jaan le gaya hai
Itna [A#] pukara tumhe [C] gala beh [Dm] gaya hai,        [Dm] Ghairon ki raahon mein
[A#] Ghairon ki baahon mein,        [C] Jab jab bhi tu [A#] soyegi
Tujhe [C] neend kabhi na [Dm] aayegi,        O o...
[Dm] O mera dil todne se pehle,        [C] Yeh soch lena, baari
[A#] aapki bhi [Dm] aayegi,        [Dm] Tere liye hi ji raha tere liye hi marega
[A#] Fark meri ye maut ka kya [Dm] apko padega,        [Dm] Paagal ne pyar kiya
[A#] Pyaar ne bekaar kiya,        [Dm] Jo jo mere [C] saath kiya
Kya [A#] tu yeh sab seh pa [C] ayegi,        [Dm] O mera dil todne se pehle
[C] Yeh soch lena, baari,        [A#] aapki bhi [Dm] aayegi
